     excess-spent-once: binds (mass-term Yukawa has the wrong range ordering; eta(r_s) <= 1.1e-07).

  [FAIL] VERDICT  the two-metric branch is ALIVE (ghost-free with a != 0 AND passes the gates run here)   (it is NOT: the BD ghost returns with a != 0 (B5); the branch is CLOSED at the mode-health gate)

